    m_Localized: INVENTORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3576939159134208
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3580626845736960
    m_Localized: THANKS FOR PLAYING!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3582426520920064
    m_Localized: "CHAKANA, GOLD OF THE GODS\nA game from EQUINOXIS STUDIOS\n\r\n\n\nExecutive
      Producer: \nDiego Narv\xE1ez\n\n\nGame Designer: \nJhon Chalco\nAriel Ramos\n\n\nArt
      Director: \nTamia Rueda\n\n\nTechnical Director: \nAlexander Inca\n\n\n\rStory
      Writer: \nFausto Ramos\n\n\nProgrammers:\nDaniel Velin\nJhon Chalco\n\n\nArtists:\nTamia
      Rueda (Character Design)\nJos\xE9 Luis Estrella (Character Animation)\nJos\xE9
      Luis Pr\xEDncipe (Cover Design) \nUrracas Studio (Scenery Design) \nErik Urgil\xE9s
      (Intro Design / Animation)\n\n\nSound Designer: \nPablo Sosa\n\n\nMusic Composer:
      \nPablo Sosa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCHAKANA, THE BLEEDING SUN\nA game from
      EQUINOXIS STUDIOS\n\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5635612383551488
    m_Localized: 'INTI bleeds over the Apus.

      His light no longer warms

      it
      only burns...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5635721859080192
    m_Localized: '-SINCHI: Shadows from the UKU PACHA have slaughtered our people.
      This is the end...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5635783125278720
    m_Localized: '-VIRACOCHA: SINCHI, raise your eyes. Your path does not end in
      this abyss.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5635806193950720
    m_Localized: '-VIRACOCHA: Take the SUNTUR. Break the cycle and purge the root
      of evil.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5635828260184064
    m_Localized: '-SINCHI: The fury of my brothers burns in my blood. We must unleash
      the PACHAKUTIY.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5679318029475840
    m_Localized: "UKUKU\xB4S STORE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5684137372852224
    m_Localized: BUY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6155689444941824
    m_Localized: "SINCHI, Jaguar Warrior\u2026 the UKU PACHA has awakened, and the
      beasts of the abyss are tracking your steps. To survive, you will need the
      powers of the earth."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6155699175727104
    m_Localized: Bring before me the Ankas Kallampa, the great luminous mushroom
      that reveals the path in darkness; the Ayahuasca extract, to bind your soul
      to the spirits; and the Supaypa Uma mask, to deceive the demons of the underworld.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6155707786633216
    m_Localized: Only by overcoming this trial will you be able to offer the SACRED
      GOLD you gathered on your journey and obtain relics that grant new powers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6155717051850752
    m_Localized: There is no victory without sacrifice, and no ascent without preparation.
      The fate of the PACHAS depends on your progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6180741888516096
    m_Localized: Jaguar Warrior, the offering is complete, and the TAMBO now recognizes
      you as its master. You have overcome the hunger of the shadows, but the journey
      has only just begun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6180744140857344
    m_Localized: Take your battle relics and prepare yourself; only the right weapon
      will be able to carve a path through the chaos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6187520689086464
    m_Localized: Bring the tribute in full, Jaguar. Only then will the doors of the
      TAMBO open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6187523016925184
    m_Localized: What do you seek, Warrior?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7106460814581760
    m_Localized: Return to Ukuku's Tambo and trade your sacred gold and relics to
      upgrade Sinchi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7209776949141504
    m_Localized: YOU DIED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7209793726357504
    m_Localized: PRESS ANY KEY TO CONTINUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587656656920576
    m_Localized: Ceremonial weapon of gold granted by Viracocha. Its blade carries
      a fragment of the divine power that shaped the world, and those who wield it
      feel the strength of the creator flowing through its sacred glow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587683055869952
    m_Localized: Strange blue mushroom that grows in the damp corners of the Andes.
      The ancients believed its energy was tied to the spirit of the mountains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587708930531328
    m_Localized: Cursed mask whispered to belong to the servants of Supay. Its hollow
      gaze seems to watch from the darkness, and those who carry it feel the cold
      breath of the underworld following every step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587711635857408
    m_Localized: Ancient brew prepared by the sages of the jungle. Its essence opens
      the mind to visions of the spirit world and the whispers of the gods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587714538315776
    m_Localized: "Sacred mask shaped after the Andean condor. Those who wear it feel
      the gaze of the sky and the ancient strength of the Kuntur. \n\nINCREASES SINCHI'S
      SKILL DAMAGE BY 25%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587716920680448
    m_Localized: 'Sacred amulet tied to the spirit of the Andean condor. Those who
      carry it are said to feel the gaze of the sky and the ancient strength of the
      Kuntur.


      INCREASES SINCHI''S HEALTH BY 50%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7587846604365824
    m_Localized: "Sacred amulet tied to the spirit of the jaguar. Those who carry
      it gain the strength and stealth of the great hunter of the jungle. \n\nINCREASES
      SUNTUR ATTACK DAMAGE BY 25%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8255534519459840
    m_Localized: REQUIRED SACRED GOLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8329041262600192
    m_Localized: Follow the path of the wind and awaken your powers to open this
      door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9044452077658112
    m_Localized: HEAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9044711361142784
    m_Localized: Heals a portion of the player's life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9044907583266816
    m_Localized: Use skills to fill the healing bar and be able to heal yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9046316810690560
    m_Localized: CONDOR SKILL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9047233828151296
    m_Localized: Creates a wind wave that damages and pushes enemies with its wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9047372974186496
    m_Localized: Jump to recharge this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9047975251075072
    m_Localized: SPEAR SKILL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9048305997111296
    m_Localized: Lunges head on with a lunge attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9048384090857472
    m_Localized: Attack enemies to recharge this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9053874598371328
    m_Localized: SNAKE SKILL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9053955292585984
    m_Localized: Throws a posion ball from the front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9054191176048640
    m_Localized: Dash to recharge this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9055680976052224
    m_Localized: PRESS ANY KEY TO RESPAWN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9056112687374336
    m_Localized: YOU DIED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9073975900954624
    m_Localized: llikay completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9074953907789824
    m_Localized: MISION COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9566310639247360
    m_Localized: 'Support us on:


'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
